# The VSIX holds only what runs: the host and webview bundles, the icon font (with its CC BY 4.0 licence), the engine
# worker with its schemas, the icon, the manifest, README and LICENSE. Everything else (sources, tests, run data, fixtures) stays out.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!media/agentduo.svg
!dist/extension.cjs
!dist/webview/main.js
!dist/webview/styles.css
!dist/webview/codicon.css
!dist/webview/codicon.ttf
!dist/webview/codicon-LICENSE.txt
!runtime/package.json
!runtime/worker.js
!runtime/schemas/*.schema.json
